            "source_segment_index": 3111,
            "start_ms": 5674150,
            "end_ms": 5675910,
            "text": "优先把镜头移交至我们第二现场"
          },
          {
            "index": 3111,
            "source_segment_index": 3112,
            "start_ms": 5675910,
            "end_ms": 5678230,
            "text": "我们两位解说老师会对本局精彩游戏进行一下"
          },
          {
            "index": 3112,
            "source_segment_index": 3113,
            "start_ms": 5678230,
            "end_ms": 5679070,
            "text": "简单复盘"
